  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#]I try to keep a good\nattitude, [F#5][E5]\n[C#]Each and every day,\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]But you're talking busi-\nness, [F#5][E5]\n[C#]When I want to play.\n[F#5]  [E5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]You're\n[F#]always in my way,\n[C#m]\n[A]You're\n[F#]always in my way.\n[C#m]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#]Sometimes I look at you,\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]I wonder if you're alive,\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]Are you cybernet-\nic? [F#5][E5]\n[C#]Or are you a jive?\n[F#5]  [E5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]You're\n[F#]always in my way,\n[C#m]\n[A]You're\n[F#]always in my way.\n[C#m]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Asus4]You're giving me\na bad attitude,\n[C#5]\n[Asus4]Every time I\nthink of you\n[E]ba-\n[B]by. [F#5][E5]\n\n[Solo]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n[C#]\n[F#5]  [E5]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]It's just not fair,\n[G5]  [F5]\n[D]When you drool on me,\n[G5]  [F5]\n[D]Then you bite my shoul-\nder, [G5][F5]\n[D]Like you're out to feed.\n[G5]  [F5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A#]You're\n[G]always in my way,\n[Dm]\n[A#]You're\n[G]always in my way,\n[Dm]\n[A#]You're\n[G]always in my way,\n[Dm]\n[A#]You're\n[G]always in my way,\n[Dm]\n[C5]  [A5]  [D]",
